# Build outputs (bitstreams, XSAs, psu_init.tcl, reports, manifests, logs) and
# board results/ are committed so teammates can use them without rebuilding.
# Only the Vivado project scratch folders are left out: they are large,
# machine-specific and regenerated by build.py.
build/*/proj/
.Xil/
*.jou
__pycache__/
# The repository root ignores vivado*.log; keep this folder's build logs as evidence.
!vivado*.log
